          "{\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"exchanged assertion eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJzdmMtcmVwb3J0aW5nIiwiaXNzIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9hdXRoLmludGVybmFsLmV4YW1wbGUiLCJleHAiOjE3NjcyMjU2MDB9.q4TnV7bXk2LwZ9pR0sYhF6dJ1aG5uEiO8cM3rTvQ6wN\"}",
